Q: Configure path-style in Java SDK Amazon S3 A: <p>For SDK v2 you can you enable path style by doing this:</p>
<pre><code>public S3Client build() {
    S3Configuration config = S3Configuration.builder()
        .pathStyleAccessEnabled(true)
        .build();

    return S3Client.builder()
        .serviceConfiguration(config)
        // other set up
        .build();
}
</code></pre>
<p><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/amazon-s3-path-deprecation-plan-the-rest-of-the-story" rel="noreferrer">Amazon was planning to deprecate path style access from Sept 2020</a>. But <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/storage/update-to-amazon-s3-path-deprecation-plan/" rel="noreferrer">this deprecation has been postponed</a>.</p>
